<MainLayout title="Our work" description="Explore the proposed areas of focus for Vijayman Unnatdhara Welfare Foundation." eyebrow="Our work"><section class="section shell"><SectionHeading title="A place for confirmed work to take shape." text="The foundation has not yet supplied a public portfolio of activities. The areas below are proposed focus areas, not claims of completed programmes." /><div class="content-list" style="margin-top:50px">{areas.map((area, index)=><article class="list-card"><span class="eyebrow">0{index+1} · Proposed area</span><h2>{area}</h2><p>Details, status, location and verified outcomes will be added when this area is approved and documented.</p></article>)}</div><TrustNote>Do not interpret these proposed categories as evidence that a programme is currently active.</TrustNote></section></MainLayout>
